" begin="01:04.305" end="01:08.325"><span begin="01:04.305" end="01:04.505">It's </span><span begin="01:04.505" end="01:04.795">dark </span><span begin="01:04.795" end="01:04.985">as </span><span begin="01:04.985" end="01:05.475">hell </span><span begin="01:05.475" end="01:05.685">and </span><span begin="01:05.685" end="01:06.165">hard </span><span begin="01:06.165" end="01:06.385">to </span><span begin="01:06.385" end="01:08.325">find</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.985" end="01:12.854"><span begin="01:09.985" end="01:10.215">You </span><span begin="01:10.215" end="01:10.675">can </span><span begin="01:10.675" end="01:10.915">climb </span><span begin="01:10.915" end="01:11.095">to </span><span begin="01:11.095" end="01:11.275">the </span><span begin="01:11.275" end="01:11.685">top </span><span begin="01:11.685" end="01:11.885">of </span><span begin="01:11.885" end="01:12.075">the </span><span begin="01:12.075" end="01:12.444">highest </span><span begin="01:12.444" end="01:12.854">tree</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.624" end="01:18.084"><span begin="01:13.624" end="01:13.824">You </span><span begin="01:13.824" end="01:14.034">can </span><span begin="01:14.034" end="01:14.274">look </span><span begin="01:14.274" end="01:14.634">around  </span><span begin="01:14.634" end="01:14.834">but </span><span begin="01:14.834" end="01:15.104">you </span><span begin="01:15.104" end="01:15.394">still </span><span begin="01:15.394" end="01:15.624">won't </span><span begin="01:15.624" end="01:18.084">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.254" end="01:20.844"><span begin="01:18.254" end="01:18.474">What </span><span begin="01:18.474" end="01:18.784">I'm </span><span begin="01:18.784" end="01:19.264">lookin' </span><span begin="01:19.264" end="01:20.844">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.014" end="01:30.492"><span begin="01:25.014" end="01:25.894">Oh  </span><span begin="01:25.894" end="01:26.323">where </span><span begin="01:26.323" end="01:26.60